ve target attacking creature you control from combat and untap it. (If you activate during end of combat, the creature will untap after it deals combat damage.)","power":null,"produced_mana":[],"released_at":"1998-06-15","toughness":null,"type_line":"Enchantment"},{"cmc":1.0,"color_identity":["W"],"colors":["W"],"defense":null,"keywords":[],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"legal","brawl":"legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"legal","duel":"legal","future":"legal","gladiator":"legal","historic":"legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"legal","paupercommander":"legal","penny":"legal","pioneer":"legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"legal","standard":"legal","standardbrawl":"legal","timeless":"legal","tlr":"legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{W}","name":"Savannah Lions","oracle_id":"60ba93eb-39e6-4af2-9c66-cd38f72daff2","oracle_text":"","power":"2","produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2024-11-15","toughness":"1","type_line":"Creature — Cat"},{"cmc":2.0,"color_identity":["G"],"colors":["G"],"defense":null,"keywords":[],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"not_legal","brawl":"legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"legal","duel":"legal","future":"not_legal","gladiator":"legal","historic":"legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"not_legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"legal","paupercommander":"legal","penny":"not_legal","pioneer":"not_legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"legal","standard":"not_legal","standardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"legal","tlr":"legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{1}{G}","name":"Tangle","oracle_id":"f627e125-15af-4e53-b34e-82b60e4ec87b","oracle_text":"Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.\nEach attacking creature doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.","power":null,"produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2014-06-16","toughness":null,"type_line":"Instant"},{"cmc":5.0,"color_identity":["U"],"colors":["U"],"defense":null,"keywords":[],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"not_legal","brawl":"banned","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"legal","duel":"banned","future":"not_legal","gladiator":"legal","historic":"banned","legacy":"legal","modern":"legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"not_legal","paupercommander":"not_legal","penny":"not_legal","pioneer":"not_legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"legal","standard":"not_legal","standardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"legal","tlr":"not_legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{3}{U}{U}","name":"Time Warp","oracle_id":"dbd6a94b-62ff-4a10-9d52-bdd90b26e425","oracle_text":"Target player takes an extra turn after this one.","power":null,"produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2026-06-26","toughness":null,"type_line":"Sorcery"}],"fixture_kind":"public_exact-list_card_data","rulings":[{"comment":"Does not undo any effects which triggered on declaration of attackers or blockers.","oracle_id":"32599d7c-243b-447b-9d5d-e8e29830ac61","published_at":"2004-10-04","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Although the Human tokens created by the triggered ability are attacking, they were never declared as attacking creatures (for the purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).","oracle_id":"38515f89-348b-4cf3-b7bd-1f6fe4ce2fba","published_at":"2021-09-24","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Attacking with any creatures will cause Adeline's last ability to trigger. Adeline doesn't have to be among them.","oracle_id":"38515f89-348b-4cf3-b7bd-1f6fe4ce2fba","published_at":"2021-09-24","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The ability that defines Adeline's power works in all zones, not just the battlefield. As long as Adeline is on the battlefield (and still a creature), that ability will count Adeline itself.","oracle_id":"38515f89-348b-4cf3-b7bd-1f6fe4ce2fba","published_at":"2021-09-24","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Tokens will be created for each of your opponents, not just opponents that you attacked.","oracle_id":"38515f89-348b-4cf3-b7bd-1f6fe4ce2fba","published_at":"2021-09-24","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"You choose whether each token is attacking that opponent or a planeswalker they control as those tokens enter the battlefield.","oracle_id":"38515f89-348b-4cf3-b7bd-1f6fe4ce2fba","published_at":"2021-09-24","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won't return to the battlefield.","oracle_id":"6879f5ce-7a1b-4606-bad1-885779b0d456","published_at":"2018-03-16","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Once the exiled permanent returns, it's considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was. Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners' graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled permanent will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist.","oracle_id":"6879f5ce-7a1b-4606-bad1-885779b0d456","published_at":"2018-03-16","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The returned card won't be the target of any spells or abilities that targeted it before. Any spells that don't target, such as Akroma's Vengeance, will still affect it.","oracle_id":"6879f5ce-7a1b-4606-bad1-885779b0d456","published_at":"2018-03-16","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"When an effect returns the exiled card \"under your control,\" you control it indefinitely after that. In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any creatures you control from Cloudshift's effect are exiled.","oracle_id":"6879f5ce-7a1b-4606-bad1-885779b0d456","published_at":"2018-03-16","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If multiple \"extra turn\" effects resolve in the same turn, take them in the reverse of the order that the effects resolved. In other words, the most recently created extra turn is taken first.","oracle_id":"dbd6a94b-62ff-4a10-9d52-bdd90b26e425","published_at":"2022-12-08","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"It identifies the creatures that are not going to untap at the time this spell resolves.","oracle_id":"f627e125-15af-4e53-b34e-82b60e4ec87b","published_at":"2004-10-04","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The creatures that are not going to untap are determined at the time this spell resolves.","oracle_id":"f627e125-15af-4e53-b34e-82b60e4ec87b","published_at":"2025-09-19","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Scryfall Oracle/rulings subset for offline tests"}
